<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Prilla Treasures"
  description="Privacy information for Prissy Toddler Tools by Prilla Treasures."
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Policy</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated 27 August 2026</p>
  </header>

  <article class="content-shell article-body">
    <div class="notice-box">
      <p><strong>Launch draft.</strong> This page must be checked against the final email, payment and analytics settings before the website is made public.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Who is responsible for this website</h2>
    <p>Prissy Toddler Tools is a store within Prilla Treasures. The website address is PrillaTreasures.com. Privacy questions can be sent to <a href="mailto:founder@prillatreasures.com">founder@prillatreasures.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>Information you choose to provide</h2>
    <p>You may provide an email address when joining an email list, downloading a free tool, making a purchase or contacting the founder. A contact email may also include the name and message you choose to send.</p>

    <h2>Purchases</h2>
    <p>Payments are handled by a hosted payment provider. This website does not store full card numbers. The provider may process contact, billing, payment, tax, fraud prevention and delivery information under its own privacy terms.</p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>If you join the email list, the email provider stores the information needed to send messages and record consent. Every marketing email must include a way to unsubscribe.</p>

    <h2>Website measurement</h2>
    <p>Lightweight website measurement may record the page visited, traffic source, device information and clicks needed to understand how the shop is used. The final analytics service and its data handling must be listed here before it is enabled.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This shop is for adults buying or using resources for children. The website does not knowingly ask children to create accounts or submit personal information.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask what personal information is held, request a correction or ask for deletion when the law permits it. Send the request to <a href="mailto:founder@prillatreasures.com">founder@prillatreasures.com</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
